### Add a course
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Python Basics",
  "description": "Learn Python fundamentals",
  "target_date": "2026-12-31",
  "status": "In Progress"
}

### Should fail: missing name
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "target_date": "2026-12-31"
}

### Should fail: bad status
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bad Course",
  "target_date": "2026-12-31",
  "status": "Kinda Started"
}

### Should fail: bad date format
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Bad Date",
  "target_date": "12/31/2026"
}

### Get course 1
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/courses/1

### Get a course that doesn't exist (expect 404)
GET http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/courses/999

### Update course 1
PUT http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/courses/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Completed"
}

### Update with bad status (expect 400)
PUT http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/courses/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "Done-ish"
}

### Add a throwaway course to delete
POST http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Delete Me",
  "target_date": "2026-10-31"
}

### Delete course 2
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/courses/2

### Delete it again (expect 404)
DELETE http://127.0.0.1:5000/api/courses/2